          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for aromatherapy consultations, VIP Day sessions, and custom blends. Safety-first, personalized aromatherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1: #0f1724; /* deep indigo */\\n      --bg-2: #06202b; /* teal midnight */\\n      --accent: #f6c89f; /* warm amber */\\n      --muted: #bcd6d6;\\n      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));color:#e6f0ef}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(246,200,159,0.18),rgba(255,255,255,0.03));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);}\\n    .logo svg{width:40px;height:40px}\\n    h1.site{font-size:18px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.6px}\\n    p.tag{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a[href$=\\\"contact.html\\\"]{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(246,200,159,0.12),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));color:#fff}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{margin-top:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:22px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .lead{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff}\\n    .sub{margin:0 0 16px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}\\n    .contact-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .contact-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n    .phone{font-size:15px}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* pattern preview */\\n    .pattern-window{height:220px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}\\n    .pattern-window svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0.12}\\n\\n    /* Social proof */\\n    .social{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .testimonial{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px}\\n    .meta-quiet{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    /* Benefits */\\n    .benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .benefit{background:var(--glass-2);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .benefit h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}\\n    .benefit p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* Process */\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(246,200,159,0.06),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .step h5{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* FAQ */\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .qa{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .q{font-weight:700}\\n    .a{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}\\n\\n    /* Lead magnet + CTA */\\n    .lead-form{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}\\n    input[type=email]{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#fff}\\n    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffd3b2);color:#102022;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    a.book{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffd3b2,rgba(246,200,159,0.9));padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;color:#102022;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n\\n    /* small screens */\\n    @media(min-width:0px) and (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .pattern-window{height:160px}\\n      .benefits{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .process{flex-direction:column}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd3b2\\\" />\\n                <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6c89f\\\" />\\n              </linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" rx=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M7 13c1.5-3 5-3 6 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#052a2f\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"site\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"tag\\\">A boutique aromatherapy studio — {{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Shop</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a Day</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"lead\\\">Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — Personal aromatherapy in {{CITY}}</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Whether you\\u2019re curious about a VIP Day experience, need guidance on safe blending, or want a custom roller, reach out and we\\u2019ll design an aromatic session tailored to you. We take a safety-first approach and never make medical claims.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"contact-grid\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"contact-row\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Call</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"phone\\\">{{PHONE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"contact-row\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Email</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"contact-row\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Location</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"meta\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — by appointment</div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">\\n              <small class=\\\"meta\\\">Prefer a focused, one-day deep-dive? Book a VIP Day to create custom blends, safety plans, and a simple daily ritual for consistent results.</small>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n              <a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"services.html\\\" style=\\\"background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);font-weight:700\\\">See Services</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside>\\n          <div class=\\\"pattern-window card\\\">\\n            <!-- Background pattern is provided at assets/img/pattern.svg for a consistent gallery look; also layered gradient here for depth -->\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 220\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n              <defs>\\n                <linearGradient id=\\\"bgx\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                  <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#082b2f\\\" />\\n                  <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0e1724\\\" />\\n                </linearGradient>\\n                <pattern id=\\\"patt\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n                  <rect width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"/>\\n                  <path d=\\\"M0 20 L40 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#f6c89f\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n                  <path d=\\\"M0 40 L40 20\\\" stroke=\\\"#f6c89f\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.04\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n                </pattern>\\n              </defs>\\n              <rect width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"220\\\" fill=\\\"url(#bgx)\\\" />\\n              <rect width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"220\\\" fill=\\\"url(#patt)\\\" />\\n              <g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.03\\\">\\n                <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"140\\\" r=\\\"90\\\" />\\n              </g>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div style=\\\"position:relative;z-index:2;padding:18px;\\\">\\n              <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Client care highlights</h3>\\n              <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Pre-visit intake, follow-up safety notes, and a tidy recipe card for each blend you take home.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"social\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"testimonial card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} helped me build a calm evening ritual — simple blends and clear safety notes.\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta-quiet\\\">Jess, local client</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"testimonial card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"Professional, knowledge-forward, and creative with scent profiles. The VIP Day was transformative for my studio routine.\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta-quiet\\\">Sam, creative entrepreneur</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"benefits\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit card\\\">\\n          <h4>Safety-first guidance</h4>\\n          <p>Clear dilution charts, patch test instructions, and pet- and pregnancy-aware recommendations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit card\\\">\\n          <h4>Custom blends</h4>\\n          <p>Tailored aroma profiles with top/mid/base notes and an easy-to-follow recipe card for home use.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit card\\\">\\n          <h4>VIP Day</h4>\\n          <p>One focused day to create a library of blends, routines, and a safety plan you can use immediately.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit card\\\">\\n          <h4>Follow-up support</h4>\\n          <p>After-care notes and 1 quick check-in to make sure blends fit into your life comfortably.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"process\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step card\\\">\\n          <h5>1. Quick intake</h5>\\n          <p>Share preferences and safety needs. No medical diagnosis; we focus on scent and ritual.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step card\\\">\\n          <h5>2. Session</h5>\\n          <p>Either a VIP Day or a short consult: we blend, test (non-medical), and make a plan.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step card\\\">\\n          <h5>3. Takeaway</h5>\\n          <p>Recipe cards, dilution guidance, and simple daily steps to use the blends safely.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Common questions</h3>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\">How should I dilute essential oils?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"a\\\">Dilution depends on purpose and age. Typical adults: 1\\u20132% for daily body application and topical roll-ons; for children or sensitive skin we use lower dilutions. At your session you'll receive a clear dilution chart and recommended carrier oils. This is educational guidance, not medical advice.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\">What is a patch test and why is it needed?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"a\\\">A patch test checks for skin sensitivity. Apply a small diluted sample to an area of inner forearm and observe for 24\\u201348 hours. If irritation occurs, discontinue. We will walk you through this during blending.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\">Are essential oils safe around pets?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"a\\\">Some oils can be problematic for pets. We always discuss pet safety and recommend pet-friendly blends or alternative use methods (diffusion schedules, closed containers, or avoidance) depending on your household.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\">Can I use aromatherapy during pregnancy?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"a\\\">Pregnancy requires extra caution. We offer pregnancy-aware recommendations and avoid certain oils. Any guidance provided is educational; consult your healthcare provider for medical advice.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Free guide: Safe Home Blends</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 12px 0\\\">Get a simple downloadable guide with dilution charts, patch-test steps, and three easy blends to try safely at home.</p>\\n\\n          <form class=\\\"lead-form\\\" id=\\\"leadForm\\\" action=\\\"#\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleLead(event)\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email\\\" required>\\n            <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send me the guide</button>\\n          </form>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">By signing up you\\u2019ll also be notified about VIP Day openings and seasonal blend launches. Privacy-respecting; no spam.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ready to book a focused session?</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">Book a VIP Day for a concentrated co-creation session where we design blends, safety plans, and a practical ritual you can follow at home.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)\\\">See Booking Options</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">Designed for clarity • VIP Days available</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function handleLead(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var email = document.getElementById('email').value;\\n      if(!email || !email.includes('@')){\\n        alert('Please enter a valid email');\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n      // Minimal simulated behavior for the static template\\n      alert('Thanks! The guide will be emailed to ' + email + '.');\\n      document.getElementById('leadForm').reset();\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Chunk 4 — contact.html + README\\n\\nThis bundle contains two files for the aromatherapy site (lux_gallery layout family):\\n\\n- contact.html — A richly styled contact page optimized for a practitioner offering VIP Day services. It includes:\\n  - Header with subtle brand block and navigation (labels varied: Home, Offerings, Blends, Shop, Book a Day, Connect).\\n  - Hero with contact details and clear safety-forward copy (no medical claims).\\n  - Social proof (client quotes).\\n  - Benefits, Process, and an FAQ section covering dilution, patch testing, pet safety, and pregnancy guidance.\\n  - Lead magnet capture (free guide) with a simple front-end handler.\\n  - Prominent CTA to book the VIP Day using placeholders: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n  - All contact placeholders left as tokens: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n\\n- README.md — This file (you are reading it) describing the chunk.\\n\\nNotes and integration:\\n- The page references a visual pattern; an assets/img/pattern.svg is expected elsewhere in the project to maintain a consistent gallery aesthetic. The contact page also includes an inline SVG layer for independent visual depth.\\n- The copy is safety-focused and avoids medical claims. The FAQ provides practical, non-medical guidance.\\n- To wire up real form handling or analytics, replace the lead form stub in contact.html with your endpoint.\\n\\nUsage:\\n- Drop contact.html into the site root along with the other pages in this project.\\n- Replace placeholder tokens with real values during templating or build.\\n- No external fonts or CDN resources are used.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsive behavior:\\n- The layout adapts from two-column to single-column under 900px.\\n- Color contrast and clear affordances prioritized for quick scanning.\\n\\nDesign decisions (practical_guide voice):\\n- Clean, professional microcopy for clients who want clear processes and safety-forward aromatherapy.\\n- VIP Day is presented as a practical, one-day offer to accelerate results rather than a vague promise.\\n\\nIf you need alternate nav labels, a different CTA layout, or an embedded map tile, request a follow-up and specify the desired behavior or service provider for mapping.\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
